research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/research-gauge.md-73-| **def-qftx-nonabelian-brst-complex** | definition / mathematics | Define the finite-jet graded-commutative local algebra, spacetime total derivatives, field/ghost parity and ghost numbers, and the differential using one Lie-algebra sign convention. Include \(sA=D_Ac\), \(sc=-\tfrac12[c,c]\), and the representation action on matter, with antighost/Nakanishi–Lautrup doublets only in a stated nonminimal extension. |
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-2026-10-23/research-gauge.md-74-| **lem-qftx-nonabelian-brst-nilpotence** | lemma / mathematics | Prove \(s^2=0\) on each generator and then on the full jet algebra using Jacobi and the representation identity; prove \(s\) commutes with total spacetime derivatives. The imported Abelian nilpotence lemma is not a supplier for the non-Abelian ghost equation. |
