+---
+id: ex-qftx-su2-wilson-lattice-transfer-sector
+kind: example
+title: A finite SU(2) Wilson lattice and its gauge-invariant transfer sector
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 4
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
